Z||000005||mrfiero||11-20-2000||12:56 AM||||Jeez Ross.....you're over-driving that thing (almost 200 miles since you bought it!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I also have a T-Top '88 GT with every available option (even rear de-fog!).  It's black w/tan leather, 5-sp., T-Tops, pw, pm, pdl, rear de-fog., p. trunk, cruise, tilt, air, gold wheels, spoiler, EQ radio w/subwoofer.    <P>I have seen a loaded T-Top'88 GT without a spoiler, but they are hard to find.  The one I saw was for sale at one of the national Fiero shows (Columbus or St. louis....can't remeber).<P>  ||||reg||1
