Z||000010||HotFieroGT||11-21-2000||01:32 PM||||I am kinda in your boat also, I bought a red 88 GT with auto and cloth interior 5 years ago, still have it, and always wanted a 5-speed.  Came across a Black 88 GT 5-sp with grey interior real cheap about a year ago.  I don't like the beachwood interior at all, so I just bought a set of gold wheels and am planning on some Mr. Mikes leather seat covers in the future.  But it just goes to show you how different peoples tastes are, I couldn't imagine having a GT without a wing.  I like looking out the back window and seeing that killer looking wing out back!<P>And on the topic of t-tops, I had an 84 Z-28 when I was a young punk and those things leaked constantly, the sunroof in the Fiero GT is the bomb.  <p>[This message has been edited by HotFieroGT (edited 11-21-2000).]||||reg||1
